 in a more neutral  position now if you're thinking why  economics so important well personally I  spend about twelve to fourteen hours a  day sitting behind my desk working away  and after a while with a bad mouse and a  bad keyboard your wrists really start to  get sore and the next day you've got  pains and your fingers and your joints  and if you think about that over a  prolonged period of time  well ten twelve twenty years down the  track you're not going to be able to  really use your wrist so much so  personally I'm investing in something  that will hopefully reduce the severity  of that effect down the long term if not  completely remove it in its entirety now  the second thing I love about this mouse  is something that I didn't really know  when I first the mouse and wasn't  surprised to me and it is by far the  best feature on this Mouse and I love it  using it so much every single day  basically  the scroll wheel is forever scrolling  now that may not sound like a big deal  to you guys but if you think about it  you're doing this all day every day just  scrolling whereas now you can do one  scroll and the mouse literally just  continues to scroll for about 15 to 20  seconds so to just simply demonstrate in  fact of how how impressive this feature  is I'm gonna put this math back down  inside a walk away and make myself cup  of tea while it's still scrolling ready  spin  [Music]  all right cup of tea made and the mouse  is just about stop scrolling now the  third and final feature why I think this  mouse is the king of all Mouse's on the  market at the moment is the fact that  it's super productive and helps you with  your workflow now you might be thinking  it's just a mouse how can it do that  well if you're somebody like me who work  for the desktop most the time and then  also has a laptop on the go and  sometimes forgets to drag all their  files off their laptop to the Google  Drive to a USB or anything like that  this Mouse makes it super simple and